      "body": "## Motivation\n\nsgl-project/sgl-kernel-xpu#593 moves `Dockerfile.xpu_kernel` from Miniforge to a uv venv at `/opt/venv`, and sgl-project/sgl-kernel-xpu#594 moves the kernel repo's own workflows to match. sglang's XPU image and CI are moving to uv in #46519.\n\n`release-whl-kernel-xpu.yml` builds that kernel Dockerfile from the kernel `release/vX.Y.Z` branch, then runs `. /miniforge3/bin/activate && conda activate py<ver>`. #46519 does not touch this file. The first kernel release branch cut after sgl-kernel-xpu#593 merges would fail at that line, and no wheel would be published.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Activate `/opt/venv` in place of the conda env.\n- Assert that the active Python matches `matrix.python-version`, so a wrong env fails right away instead of producing a wheel for the wrong Python.\n\n`scripts/build_rel_wheel.py` needs no change: it calls `sys.executable -m pip`, and the uv venv is created with `--seed`, so pip is present.\n\n## Merge order\n\nMerge after sgl-kernel-xpu#593 and before the first kernel release branch cut from it (`release/v0.6.0`). This is uv only, so releases from `release/v0.5.0` or older branches, which still build the conda image, can no longer be built with this workflow.\n\n## Testing\n\n- pre-commit passes.\n- Ran the step's shell body (up to the wheel build) with `python-version=3.12`:\n  - uv image built from sgl-kernel-xpu#593: `/opt/venv/bin/python`, Python 3.12.14, assert passes.\n  - conda image `intel/sgl-kernel-xpu-dev:latest`: fails at once on `/opt/venv/bin/activate: No such file or directory`, as expected.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #41796303908](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41796303908)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41796303967](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41796303967)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
